#: source/how-to/launch_app.rst:4
msgid "Deep-dive into the simulation launcher"
msgstr "深入了解仿真启动器"

#: source/how-to/launch_app.rst:8
msgid ""
"In this tutorial, we will dive into how a standalone script launches the "
"simulator and configures it using CLI arguments and environment variables "
"(envars). Particularly, we will demonstrate how to use "
":func:`app.add_launcher_args` and :func:`app.launch_simulation` to enable "
"livestreaming and to configure the "
":class:`isaacsim.simulation_app.SimulationApp` instance that runs Isaac Sim,"
" while also allowing user-provided options."
msgstr ""
"本教程深入介绍独立脚本如何启动仿真器，并通过命令行参数和环境变量进行配置。我们将重点展示如何用 "
":func:`app.add_launcher_args` 和 :func:`app.launch_simulation` 启用实时串流、配置运行 "
"Isaac Sim 的 :class:`isaacsim.simulation_app.SimulationApp` 实例，同时支持用户自定义选项。"

#: source/how-to/launch_app.rst:14
msgid ""
"Launching is split into two steps. First, :func:`app.add_launcher_args` "
"appends the launch-related options to the script's own "
":class:`argparse.ArgumentParser`. Then, the :func:`app.launch_simulation` "
"context manager takes the simulation configuration and the parsed arguments,"
" and starts only the runtime that they need. The default PhysX physics "
"backend, Kit-based RTX cameras, the Kit visualizer (``--visualizer kit``) "
"and livestreaming all run inside Isaac Sim (Kit), so for these "
":func:`~app.launch_simulation` starts a "
":class:`~isaacsim.simulation_app.SimulationApp`. A kitless configuration, "
"for example Newton physics without a Kit visualizer, starts no Isaac Sim at "
"all. The runtime is closed automatically when the ``with`` block exits."
msgstr ""
"启动分为两步。首先， :func:`app.add_launcher_args` 向脚本自身的 "
":class:`argparse.ArgumentParser` 添加启动相关选项。随后， :func:`app.launch_simulation` "
"上下文管理器接收仿真配置和已解析的参数，只启动实际需要的运行时。默认 PhysX 物理后端、基于 Kit 的 RTX 相机、Kit 可视化器（ "
"``--visualizer kit`` ）和实时串流都运行在 Isaac Sim（Kit）内，因此这些情况会由 "
":func:`~app.launch_simulation` 启动 "
":class:`~isaacsim.simulation_app.SimulationApp` 。不依赖 Kit 的配置，例如不使用 Kit 可视化器的"
" Newton 物理，则完全不会启动 Isaac Sim。离开 ``with`` 块时，运行时自动关闭。"

#: source/how-to/launch_app.rst:23
msgid ""
"The :class:`~isaacsim.simulation_app.SimulationApp` has many extensions that"
" must be loaded to enable different capabilities, and some of these "
"extensions are order- and inter-dependent. Additionally, there are startup "
"options such as ``headless`` which must be set at instantiation time, and "
"which have an implied relationship with some extensions, e.g. the "
"livestreaming extensions. The launcher handles these extensions and startup "
"options in a portable manner across a variety of use cases. To achieve this,"
" we offer CLI and envar flags which can be merged with user-defined CLI "
"args, while passing forward arguments intended for "
":class:`~isaacsim.simulation_app.SimulationApp`."
msgstr ""
":class:`~isaacsim.simulation_app.SimulationApp` "
"必须加载相应扩展才能启用不同功能，有些扩展还存在加载顺序要求或相互依赖。此外， ``headless`` "
"等启动选项必须在实例化时设置，并与某些扩展（例如实时串流扩展）存在关联。启动器以适用于多种场景的统一方式处理这些扩展和启动选项。为此，我们提供可与用户自定义命令行参数合并的命令行和环境变量选项，并转交面向"
" :class:`~isaacsim.simulation_app.SimulationApp` 的参数。"

